[I] C++ library to read and write DXF/DWG files

[T] libdxfrw is a free C++ library to read and write DXF CAD files in both
[T] ASCII and binary form. It can also read DWG files from R14 to V2015 and
[T] is used by LibreCAD.

[U] https://github.com/LibreCAD/libdxfrw/

